# Bag USE of field items, decomp ItemActionFunc_Use → UseBicycleFromMenu): the Bicycle
# used from the bag. In Eterna the bag and the start menu close and the field mounts the bike; the bike
# rides through the Cycling Road north gate (bikes only) onto Route 206, where the bag refuses getting off
# (CanUseBicycle: Bag_Text_CannotDismount, printed in the bag). The refusal texts are unit-tested.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 12
give item platinum:ITEM_BICYCLE 1
# Eterna, south of the Cycling Road gate: USE gets on the bike
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_CITY 304 567 down
until idle
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:1
+1 assert app bag
+1 tap pocket:7
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
until app none
until state playerState "cycle"
+0 screenshot cycling
until idle
# Through the gate on the bike, onto Cycling Road
+1 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_206_CYCLING_ROAD_NORTH_GATE"
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_206"
+0 release down
until idle
+0 assert state playerState "cycle"
# On Cycling Road the bag refuses getting off
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:1
+1 tap pocket:7
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
+1 assert app bag
+0 assert state playerState "cycle"
+1 press a
+1 release a
+1 press b
+1 release b
+1 press b
+1 release b
until app none
+0 assert state playerState "cycle"
# Back up into the gate (Route 206's onResume rewrites its map-local vars on a load, as on the DS: the save
# round trip is taken in the gate)
+1 press down
until position 304 577
+0 release down
until idle
+1 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_206_CYCLING_ROAD_NORTH_GATE"
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert state playerState "cycle"
